{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1120815-question-on-a-long-term-trip-in-the-shadowlands-for-a-demon","id":1120815,"title":"Question on a long-term trip in the Shadowlands for a Demon","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-26T08:29:47-07:00","id":1120815,"title":"Question on a long-term trip in the Shadowlands for a Demon","content":"In the story that I'm running, a slayer and a malefactor will be within the Tempest for a long time (weeks...months). I am aware of the dangers given the general nature of the Tempest and in particular the power Hell has over demons when they enter the Tempest. My question is about food, though. The demon is in a mortal body and typically needs to eat, but they will be in the landds of the dead. What are your thoughts about a workaround for this? I'm thinking the players could spend a faith point each day to &quot;eat.&quot; Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13564-trategos_sol","name":"Trategos_Sol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13564_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T12:02:42-07:00","id":1120937,"title":"","content":"Maybe a Faith Point every two or three days (or more) for a Demon to sustain their body in these circumstances?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3254,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","user":"Muad'Dib","date":". 07-26-2017, 03:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T12:06:00-07:00","id":1120938,"title":"","content":"I agree with making it a faith expenditure, like Garou expend Gnosis. With a pact you would be able to sustain yourself rather easily, as your faith recharges every day.<br /> Your mortal body would, probably, be transformed into something akin to plasma in order to exist in the Wraith Umbra (that's how these things usually work, to my knowledge), allowing you to feed it with spiritual power (faith). In the Umbra certain forms of spiritual &quot;food&quot; are edible, I don't know if these kind of things can be found in the Tempest, even if they can I imagine it would be a rare sight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T12:25:11-07:00","id":1120949,"title":"","content":"thanks for the feedback!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13564-trategos_sol","name":"Trategos_Sol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13564_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}